WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.076 --> 00:00:05.915
"I hope Cozlin isn't too upset with me," Roxy thought.

2
00:00:05.916 --> 00:00:10.276
She had spent the past few hours watching as fighters paired up and battled.

3
00:00:10.277 --> 00:00:12.675
The Battle Master appeared on his platform.

4
00:00:12.676 --> 00:00:18.978
"Next we have Kothar, the terror with four arms!"

5
00:00:18.979 --> 00:00:23.542
The crowd cheered as a massive, hairy beast drifted to the middle of the stadium.

6
00:00:23.543 --> 00:00:31.598
The Battle Master continued. "His partner is Volgren, from the ocean planet Zell!"

7
00:00:31.599 --> 00:00:33.740
He waited for the crowd to grow quiet.

8
00:00:33.741 --> 00:00:40.694
"They will fight Rocket Girl and Sun Wukong!"

9
00:00:40.695 --> 00:00:45.028
A moment later Roxy and Wukong stood on the stadium floor.

10
00:00:45.029 --> 00:00:49.480
Wukong twirled his iron bar. "This will be fun!"

11
00:00:49.481 --> 00:00:52.923
Roxy shook her head. "Fighting isn't fun at all.

12
00:00:52.924 --> 00:00:55.442
And we both need to get back home."

13
00:00:55.443 --> 00:01:01.096
Wukong shrugged. "You're right. Let's win this battle quickly."

14
00:01:01.097 --> 00:01:03.986
Volgren attacked, swinging tentacles.

15
00:01:03.987 --> 00:01:08.582
Roxy dodged it and then fired her eye laser beams. Whiz-hoo!

16
00:01:08.583 --> 00:01:11.540
"Aargh!" Volgren cried.

17
00:01:11.541 --> 00:01:13.624
"Nice shot, Rocket Girl!"

18
00:01:13.625 --> 00:01:18.028
Wukong swung his iron bar at Kothar, who blocked it with one of his arms.

19
00:01:18.029 --> 00:01:21.241
"Ouch!" The beast rubbed his arm.

20
00:01:21.242 --> 00:01:26.127
Wukong laughed. Kothar snarled and charged toward him.

21
00:01:26.128 --> 00:01:29.988
He grabbed Wukong in one of his huge hands and squeezed hard.

22
00:01:29.989 --> 00:01:32.289
Wukong tried to break free.

23
00:01:32.290 --> 00:01:39.256
Kothar laughed. "You'll never escape from—"

24
00:01:39.257 --> 00:01:42.655
Wukong turned into a fish and slipped out of the beast's hand.

25
00:01:42.656 --> 00:01:47.197
He flopped on the ground and then turned into a wasp. Buzz!

26
00:01:47.198 --> 00:01:51.611
Kothar ran around, waving his arms. "Don't sting me!"

27
00:01:51.612 --> 00:01:54.240
Roxy darted toward Volgren.

28
00:01:54.241 --> 00:01:58.105
Pow! She threw the alien into the stadium wall.

29
00:01:58.106 --> 00:02:01.108
"Grr!" Volgren climbed to her feet.

30
00:02:01.109 --> 00:02:05.420
Then she spread out her tentacles, revealing rows of shiny eggs.

31
00:02:05.421 --> 00:02:09.452
Fwoomp! An egg shot at Roxy, and she jumped out of the way.

32
00:02:09.453 --> 00:02:13.199
The egg hit the wall. Ka-boom!

33
00:02:13.200 --> 00:02:17.470
"Yikes!" Roxy cried. "An exploding egg!"

34
00:02:17.471 --> 00:02:21.751
Fwoomp! Another egg shot toward Roxy.

35
00:02:21.752 --> 00:02:25.237
She ducked, and it hit Kothar in the face. Ka-boom!

36
00:02:25.238 --> 00:02:28.388
"Ow!" The hairy beast rubbed his eyes.

37
00:02:28.389 --> 00:02:31.400
"That hurt, Volgren! Watch where you're—"

38
00:02:31.401 --> 00:02:35.407
Buzz! Wukong zipped into the beast's ear.

39
00:02:35.408 --> 00:02:38.086
He raised his stinger and stabbed.

40
00:02:38.087 --> 00:02:42.877
"Aargh!" Kothar howled in pain as Wukong flew back out.

41
00:02:42.878 --> 00:02:45.099
Volgren fired more eggs.

42
00:02:45.100 --> 00:02:47.415
Roxy took a deep breath and then blew.

43
00:02:47.416 --> 00:02:52.740
Whoo-oo-oosh! Her super breath blew the eggs back toward Volgren.

44
00:02:52.741 --> 00:02:56.378
Volgren's eyes went wide. "Uh-oh!"

45
00:02:56.379 --> 00:03:01.165
Boom! She flew backward, slamming into the wall. "Oof!"

46
00:03:01.166 --> 00:03:04.495
Slowly she stood up.

47
00:03:04.496 --> 00:03:08.350
Roxy fired her eye laser beams. Whiz-hoo!

48
00:03:08.351 --> 00:03:13.592
They blasted the eggs, setting off multiple explosions.

49
00:03:13.593 --> 00:03:18.461
When the smoke cleared, Volgren raised her tentacles. "I give up!"

50
00:03:18.462 --> 00:03:21.956
"Well, I don't!" Kothar leaped toward Wukong.

51
00:03:21.957 --> 00:03:23.777
The monkey stepped to the side.

52
00:03:23.778 --> 00:03:29.027
As soon as Kothar landed, Wukong slammed his bar onto the beast's toes.

53
00:03:29.028 --> 00:03:33.831
"Yow!" Kothar hopped on one foot, rubbing his toes.

54
00:03:33.832 --> 00:03:37.395
Then he swung a hairy fist. Pow!

55
00:03:37.396 --> 00:03:41.496
It sent Wukong flying into the crowd, crashing into the blue alien.

56
00:03:41.497 --> 00:03:46.020
The alien looked down at his spilled drink. "Oh man!"

57
00:03:46.021 --> 00:03:49.353
Kothar held up four fists as the crowd cheered.

58
00:03:49.354 --> 00:03:53.425
"That's right! I'm the best! Nobody can . . ."

59
00:03:53.426 --> 00:03:55.827
A huge shadow grew over Kothar.

60
00:03:55.828 --> 00:03:57.649
He looked up and gulped.

61
00:03:57.650 --> 00:04:02.405
Wukong towered over him. "Do you still want to fight?"

62
00:04:02.406 --> 00:04:05.918
Kothar's shoulders slumped. "No."

63
00:04:05.919 --> 00:04:12.843
The crowd cheered as the Battle Master declared Roxy and Wukong the winners.

